
DESCRIPTION
-----------

FDSN waveforms for use by MTUQ



INITIAL DOWNLOAD
----------------

To download waveforms for all events in "events.tsv":


1. >> conda activate pysep
   >> append-path ~/devel/pysep_utils/bin
   >> append-pythonpath ~/devel/pysep_utils/src

2. >> setup.bash events.tsv

3. >> run.bash

4. >> push_waveforms <EVENT_NAME>



SUBSEQUENT DOWNLOADS
--------------------

Waveforms will be available at

    github.com/rmodrak/waveforms_fdsn/tree/<EVENT_NAME>


